d Brightness Intelligence (B.I.)—the GW2283 reduces eye strain during long working or browsing sessions. Its slim bezel design, built-in cable management, and dual HDMI connectivity make it a clean and versatile solution for any desk setup.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're working, studying, watching movies, or browsing the web, the BenQ GW2283 delivers smooth performance with a 60Hz refresh rate, 5ms response time, and high-quality color reproduction. This monitor is energy-efficient, stylish, and built for productivity and comfortable everyday use.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/benq-rd240q-241-2k-wqxga-programming-monitor\">BenQ RD240Q 24.1” 2K+ WQXGA Programming Monitor</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">54,000৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">58,500৳</span> \n                        